e access; and predictive analytics. It serves education, healthcare, travel, and B2B industries. The company was formerly known as peerTransfer Corporation and changed its name to Flywire Corporation in December 2016. Flywire Corporation was incorporated in 2009 and is headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts."}}